---
import Layout from '../layouts/LayoutV4.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Private Health Insurance Germany: Free Advice for Expats"
  description="Private health insurance in Germany, explained in English. Check if you qualify, compare costs and talk to a licensed broker. Our whole service is free."
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline set:html={JSON.stringify({"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is your service really free?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, all of it: the consultation, the comparison, the application and the paperwork. You pay nothing extra and you are under no obligation."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I get private health insurance as an employee?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Private health insurance is open to employees earning over €77,400 a year (2026). From 2027 the threshold is expected to rise to €84,150 (not final yet). Below that, public insurance is generally required."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can freelancers choose private health insurance?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Freelancers and self-employed people can choose private from day one. We compare it with the public option for your case."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need to speak German?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Your broker speaks English and handles the paperwork with the insurer."}}]})} />
  <main id="top">
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="tag">For expats, explained in English</span>
      <h1>Private health insurance in Germany</h1>
      <p class="lede">Is it right for you? Honest answers from licensed brokers, before you sign anything.</p>
      <ul class="checks">
        <li><span class="ck"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5" fill="none" stroke="#10201E" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><div><b>Free from first call to paperwork</b><span class="s">No fees, no obligation.</span></div></li>
        <li><span class="ck"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5" fill="none" stroke="#10201E" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><div><b>Public or private, side by side</b><span class="s">If public suits you better, we say so.</span></div></li>
        <li><span class="ck"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5" fill="none" stroke="#10201E" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><div><b>English support after you sign</b><span class="s">Letters, claims and changes, explained.</span></div></li>
      </ul>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn" href="/free-consultation">Free consultation <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="#elig">Check if you qualify</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-note">Five short questions, about two minutes. A broker calls you back in English.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-vis">
      <div class="hero-card"><img src="/images/photos/pastel-hero-woman-pink.webp" alt="Smiling woman checking her private health insurance on her phone" width="1024" height="1024" fetchpriority="high"></div>
      <div class="float free"><span class="big">&euro;0</span><span>What you pay us for our whole service</span></div>
      <figure class="float q">
        <p>&ldquo;She was very patient with my questions and explained everything in detail with full transparency.&rdquo;</p>
        <figcaption class="by"><svg class="li" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M20.45 20.45h-3.56v-5.57c0-1.33-.02-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.85 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.35V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.48-.9 1.64-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 1 1 0-4.13 2.06 2.06 0 0 1 0 4.13zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .77 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.23.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.77 1.78-1.73V1.73C24 .77 23.2 0 22.22 0z"/></svg><span><b>Rohan T.</b> on LinkedIn, Aug 2024</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="elig-band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="elig" id="elig">
        <div class="elig-side">
          <div><span class="tag">Eligibility Check</span><h2>Can you get private health insurance?</h2></div>
          <p>Two questions, 20 seconds. No sign-up.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="elig-main">
          <div class="elig-top"><span id="elig-step">Question 1 of 2</span><span><button type="button" class="elig-back" id="elig-back" hidden>&larr; Back</button><button type="button" class="elig-again" id="elig-again" hidden>Start again</button></span></div>
          <div class="estep" data-s="1">
            <h3 tabindex="-1">What's your situation?</h3>
            <div class="opts">
              <button type="button" class="opt" data-a="emp">Employee</button>
              <button type="button" class="opt" data-a="self">Self-employed or freelancer</button>
              <button type="button" class="opt" data-a="stu">Student</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="estep" data-s="2" hidden>
            <h3 tabindex="-1">Is your gross yearly income above &euro;77,400?</h3>
            <p class="q-sub">That is the 2026 threshold for employees.</p>
            <div class="opts">
              <button type="button" class="opt" data-a="yes">Yes</button>
              <button type="button" class="opt" data-a="no">No</button>
              <button type="button" class="opt" data-a="unsure">Not sure</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="estep" data-s="r" hidden aria-live="polite">
            <h3 id="res-h" tabindex="-1"></h3>
            <p class="res-text" id="res-p"></p>
            <div class="res-actions"><a class="btn" href="/free-consultation">Get a free consultation <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a><a class="l" href="#costs-calculator">See what it would cost</a></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec warm" id="who">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <h2>Who private health insurance <span class="acc">is for</span></h2>
      <p>It works very differently depending on how you earn. Pick your situation.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="who-grid">
      <a class="row wide reveal" href="/free-consultation"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/photos/pillar-expats-street.webp" alt="Expats walking through a German city" loading="lazy"></div><div><h3>Expats new to Germany</h3><p>Not sure how the German system works? We explain public and private health insurance in plain English first, then you decide.</p></div><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      <a class="row reveal" href="/free-consultation"><div class="ph" style="background:#F6D9DC"><img src="/images/photos/pastel-man-laptop-pink.webp" alt="Employee with a laptop" loading="lazy"></div><div><h3>Employees</h3><p>Open above &euro;77,400 a year. Your employer pays up to half.</p></div><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      <a class="row reveal" href="/free-consultation"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/photos/pastel-man-mint.webp" alt="Freelancer checking his phone" loading="lazy"></div><div><h3>Freelancers and self-employed</h3><p>You can choose private from day one, at any income.</p></div><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      <a class="row reveal" href="/free-consultation"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/photos/pastel-student-blue.webp" alt="Student holding a notebook" loading="lazy"></div><div><h3>Students</h3><p>One choice at the start of your studies. We check yours.</p></div><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      <a class="row reveal" href="/free-consultation"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/photos/pillar-family-park.webp" alt="Family walking in a park" loading="lazy"></div><div><h3>Families</h3><p>Children and partners change the maths. We show both sides.</p></div><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="costs-calculator">
  <div class="wrap calc-grid">
    <div class="calc-intro reveal">
      <span class="tag">Costs</span>
      <h2 style="margin-top:16px">What would private health insurance <span class="acc">cost you?</span></h2>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px;font-size:18px;max-width:520px">Set your age and income and compare public and private side by side. It is an estimate, not a quote.</p>
      <ul class="checks">
        <li><span class="ck"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5" fill="none" stroke="#10201E" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><div><b>Public depends on your income</b><span class="s">A share of your salary, up to the contribution ceiling.</span></div></li>
        <li><span class="ck"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5" fill="none" stroke="#10201E" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><div><b>Private depends on you</b><span class="s">Your age when you start, your health and the plan you pick.</span></div></li>
      </ul>
      <div class="ph"><img src="/images/photos/nb-couple-sofa.webp" alt="Couple comparing private health insurance costs on a laptop at home" loading="lazy"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="calc reveal" id="calc">
      <h3>Public vs private</h3>
      <p class="sub">Your monthly share, 2026.</p>
      <div class="toggle" role="group" aria-label="Employment type">
        <button type="button" data-m="emp" aria-pressed="true">Employee</button>
        <button type="button" data-m="self" aria-pressed="false">Self-employed</button>
      </div>
      <div class="inc-row"><span class="label">Your age</span><span class="inc-val" id="agev">32</span></div>
      <input type="range" id="age" min="20" max="60" step="1" value="32" aria-label="Your age">
      <div class="ticks"><span>20</span><span>40</span><span>60</span></div>
      <div class="inc-row inc-gap"><span class="label">Gross income per year</span><span class="inc-val" id="incv">&euro;85,000</span></div>
      <input type="range" id="inc" min="20000" max="200000" step="1000" value="85000" aria-label="Gross income per year">
      <div class="ticks"><span>&euro;20k</span><span>&euro;77.4k threshold</span><span>&euro;200k</span></div>
      <div class="res" aria-live="polite">
        <div class="closed" id="closed">Private health insurance is not open to employees under &euro;77,400 a year yet. Talk to us about what changes that: a raise, a job switch or self-employment.</div>
        <div class="bar" id="bpub"><div class="n" id="pubn">Public</div><div class="track"><div class="fill pub" id="pubf"></div><span class="lbl" id="publ"></span></div></div>
        <div class="bar" id="bpriv"><div class="n" id="privn">Private</div><div class="track"><div class="fill priv" id="privf"></div><span class="lbl" id="privl"></span></div></div>
        <p class="note" id="note"></p>
        <p class="age-hint" id="ageh">Over 45, private health insurance needs a careful look at long-term premiums. Talk to us before you decide.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="fine">Illustrative 2026 estimate, your quote depends on age, health and plan. Private range shown for a healthy person of your age starting a mid-range plan now; employer share capped at &euro;508.59 a month. No savings are guaranteed.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec warm" id="costs-numbers">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal"><h2>Three numbers that <span class="acc">decide it</span></h2></div>
    <div class="nums reveal">
      <div class="num"><span class="k">Income threshold 2026</span><div class="big">&euro;<span class="cu" data-to="77400">77,400</span></div><p>Employees earning more than this a year can choose private health insurance. From 2027 the threshold is expected to rise to &euro;84,150 (not final yet).</p></div>
      <div class="num"><span class="k">Contribution ceiling 2026</span><div class="big">&euro;<span class="cu" data-to="5812.50" data-dec="2">5,812.50</span></div><p>Monthly income up to which public health insurance charges contributions.</p></div>
      <div class="num"><span class="k">What you pay us</span><div class="big">&euro;0</div><p>For our whole service: advice, comparison, application and paperwork.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal"><span class="tag">English-speaking concierge</span><h2 style="margin-top:16px">Still here <span class="acc">after you sign</span></h2><p>Signing is not the end of it. You keep the broker who arranged your private health insurance.</p></div>
    <div class="comp">
      <div class="comp-row reveal"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/photos/nb-man-sofa.webp" alt="Man reading a message from his insurer on his phone" loading="lazy"></div><div><h3>German letters, explained in English</h3><p>A letter from your insurer arrives and you are not sure what it wants. Send it to us and we tell you what it means and what to do.</p></div></div>
      <div class="comp-row reveal"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/photos/row-man-homeoffice.webp" alt="Man on a phone call in his home office" loading="lazy"></div><div><h3>Claims and doctors&rsquo; invoices</h3><p>With private health insurance you often pay the doctor first and claim it back. We help when a claim gets stuck.</p><p class="comp-q">&ldquo;Great service end to end from upfront selection and switching to on-going day to day support.&rdquo;<small>Anish P., on LinkedIn, August 2024</small></p></div></div>
      <div class="comp-row reveal"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/photos/row-couple-balcony.webp" alt="Couple on their balcony looking at a tablet" loading="lazy"></div><div><h3>Changes when your life changes</h3><p>You marry, have a child or change jobs. We check what that means for your plan and handle the paperwork.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec warm" id="insurers">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal"><h2>How it works: four steps, <span class="acc">no obligation</span></h2></div>
    <ol class="steps reveal" style="list-style:none">
      <li class="step"><h3>Tell us your situation</h3><p>A short form: income, job, family.</p></li>
      <li class="step"><h3>A broker calls you back</h3><p>In English. You talk to a person, not a chatbot.</p></li>
      <li class="step"><h3>Compare and decide</h3><p>Options side by side. Public may still be your answer.</p></li>
      <li class="step"><h3>We handle the paperwork</h3><p>Applications, forms and the switch are on us.</p></li>
    </ol>
    <div class="adv reveal" style="margin-top:72px">
      <div class="person"><img class="mono" src="/images/photos/advisor-bettina-ostermann.webp" alt="Bettina Ostermann, senior insurance advisor" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy"><div><h3>Bettina Ostermann</h3><div class="role">Senior insurance advisor</div><div class="lic">IHK-licensed broker &sect; 34d GewO</div></div></div>
      <div class="person"><img class="mono" src="/images/photos/advisor-michael-kammerer.webp" alt="Michael Kammerer, senior insurance advisor" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy"><div><h3>Michael Kammerer</h3><div class="role">Senior insurance advisor</div><div class="lic">IHK-licensed broker &sect; 34d GewO</div></div></div>
      <div class="adv-note"><b>Your advisors speak English and call you back themselves.</b><a class="btn yel sm" href="/free-consultation">Free consultation <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="reviews" aria-labelledby="rv-t">
  <div class="wrap rv-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:40px">
    <div class="sec-head" style="margin:0"><h2 id="rv-t">Private health insurance advice, <span class="acc">in their words</span></h2><p>Public recommendations our clients wrote for Bettina and Michael on LinkedIn, quoted word for word.</p></div>
    <div class="rv-ctrl"><button class="rv-btn rv-prev" type="button" aria-label="Previous recommendations">&#8592;</button><button class="rv-btn rv-next" type="button" aria-label="Next recommendations">&#8594;</button></div>
  </div>
  <div class="rv-track" aria-label="Client recommendations">
    <div class="rv-run">
    <ul class="rv-list">
      <li class="rv"><blockquote>
        <div class="rv-src"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M20.45 20.45h-3.56v-5.57c0-1.33-.02-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.85 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.35V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.48-.9 1.64-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 1 1 0-4.13 2.06 2.06 0 0 1 0 4.13zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .77 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.23.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.77 1.78-1.73V1.73C24 .77 23.2 0 22.22 0z"/></svg><span>For Bettina on LinkedIn &middot; August 2024</span></div>
        <h3>Patient, detailed and fully transparent</h3>
        <div class="rv-body"><p>Bettina guided me to choose the right private health insurance for myself in Germany. She was very patient with my questions and explained everything in detail with full transparency.</p><p>I would strongly recommend Bettina and her team for private health insurance related services. Her team’s support even after you sign, is excellent!</p></div>
        <div class="rv-by"><span class="rv-ini" aria-hidden="true">RT</span><cite>Rohan T.</cite></div>
      </blockquote></li>
      <li class="rv"><blockquote>
        <div class="rv-src"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M20.45 20.45h-3.56v-5.57c0-1.33-.02-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.85 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.35V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.48-.9 1.64-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 1 1 0-4.13 2.06 2.06 0 0 1 0 4.13zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .77 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.23.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.77 1.78-1.73V1.73C24 .77 23.2 0 22.22 0z"/></svg><span>For Bettina on LinkedIn &middot; August 2024</span></div>
        <h3>Great service end to end</h3>
        <div class="rv-body"><p>Great service end to end from upfront selection and switching to on-going day to day support from Bettina and team. Thanks</p></div>
        <div class="rv-by"><span class="rv-ini" aria-hidden="true">AP</span><cite>Anish P.</cite></div>
      </blockquote></li>
      <li class="rv"><blockquote>
        <div class="rv-src"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M20.45 20.45h-3.56v-5.57c0-1.33-.02-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.85 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.35V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.48-.9 1.64-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 1 1 0-4.13 2.06 2.06 0 0 1 0 4.13zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .77 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.23.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.77 1.78-1.73V1.73C24 .77 23.2 0 22.22 0z"/></svg><span>For Michael on LinkedIn &middot; March 2024</span></div>
        <h3>Transparent about every option, and quick to answer</h3>
        <div class="rv-body"><p>From the initial call and throughout the onboarding process, my experience with Michael has been straightforward and positive. He was very transparent about the different insurance plans, ensuring I understood all the options available. His responsiveness stood out, as he promptly answered all my questions, no matter how many I had. Additionally, he offered valuable advice regarding my current plan and what I would need in the future, helping me make informed decisions. Based on my experience, I highly recommend him as an insurance advisor.</p></div>
        <div class="rv-by"><span class="rv-ini" aria-hidden="true">SP</span><cite>Sharvesh P.</cite></div>
      </blockquote></li>
      <li class="rv"><blockquote>
        <div class="rv-src"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M20.45 20.45h-3.56v-5.57c0-1.33-.02-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.85 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.35V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.48-.9 1.64-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 1 1 0-4.13 2.06 2.06 0 0 1 0 4.13zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .77 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.23.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.77 1.78-1.73V1.73C24 .77 23.2 0 22.22 0z"/></svg><span>For Michael on LinkedIn &middot; March 2024</span></div>
        <h3>Makes German health insurance a whole lot easier</h3>
        <div class="rv-body"><p>Dealing with health insurance in Germany can be tricky, but having Michael Kammerer on your side makes it a whole lot easier. He's got this knack for breaking down the complicated parts so you can actually understand what's what, and he really listens to what you need.</p><p>Michael isn't just about getting you any insurance; he makes sure it's the right fit for you. He took care of all the boring paperwork and was always just a message away whenever I had a question or needed help.</p><p>I'd recommend Michael to anyone who needs to get their health insurance sorted in Germany. He's not just another broker; he's like having a buddy who knows everything about insurance and wants to help you out.</p></div>
        <div class="rv-by"><span class="rv-ini" aria-hidden="true">RB</span><cite>Raphaël B.</cite></div>
      </blockquote></li>
      <li class="rv"><blockquote>
        <div class="rv-src"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M20.45 20.45h-3.56v-5.57c0-1.33-.02-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.85 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.35V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.48-.9 1.64-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 1 1 0-4.13 2.06 2.06 0 0 1 0 4.13zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .77 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.23.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.77 1.78-1.73V1.73C24 .77 23.2 0 22.22 0z"/></svg><span>For Bettina on LinkedIn &middot; October 2023</span></div>
        <h3>Switching from public to private made simple</h3>
        <div class="rv-body"><p>I've got to give a shoutout to Bettina for helping me switch from my old German health insurance to a private plan. She really knows her stuff and made the whole process super easy.</p><p>Bettina laid out a bunch of different private insurance options and broke down the comparisons so I could easily pick the right one for me. She also had my back when it came to all the paperwork, and she was always just a message away if I had questions.</p><p>Bettina's expertise and awesome customer service made a big difference in my insurance game. If you're looking to make the switch, I can't recommend her enough!</p></div>
        <div class="rv-by"><span class="rv-ini" aria-hidden="true">VI</span><cite>Vladimir I.</cite></div>
      </blockquote></li>
      <li class="rv"><blockquote>
